# openi2pd: control.
#
# Debian control metadata for the architecture-specific static i2pd package
# built with musl and bundled OpenSSL, Boost, zlib and miniupnpc.
#

Source: i2pd
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: openi2pd maintainers <daviduhden@users.noreply.github.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.5.1
Homepage: https://github.com/daviduhden/openi2pd
Rules-Requires-Root: binary-targets

Package: i2pd
Architecture: amd64 arm64 armhf i386 s390x
Depends: adduser, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Full-featured C++ implementation of I2P client (static build)
 I2P (Invisible Internet Protocol) is a universal anonymous network layer.
 .
 This package ships a fully static binary (musl, bundled OpenSSL, Boost,
 zlib and miniupnpc) that does not depend on the distribution release.
